{"schema":"clawhub.skill.verify.v1","ok":true,"decision":"pass","reasons":[],"slug":"novel-generator","displayName":"novel-generator 是一个中文爽文小说生成技能。用户只需提供一句话方向（如\"写个都市重生爽文\"），AI 代理即可自动完善提示词、规划大纲、逐章创作并输出为独立 Markdown 文件。  核心特性：  智能提示词生成：从一句话方向自动补全世界观、人设、冲突、爽点设计 分章节创作：每章 2000-3000 字，层层递进，章章有爽点 记忆系统：通过 .learnings/ 记录角色、地点、情节、世界观，确保故事前后一致 情节图解：关键战斗、人物关系、势力分布自动生成 Mermaid 图 失败记录：穿帮、矛盾、崩塌等问题自动记录，持续优化 多题材支持：都市、修仙、玄幻、重生、系统流、末世、科幻、游戏 兼容 Claude Code、Cursor、OpenAI Codex、GitHub Copilot 等所有支持 Agent Skills 的工具。","pageUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/ityhg/skills/novel-generator","publisherHandle":"ityhg","publisherDisplayName":"ITYHG","publisherProfileUrl":"https://clawhub.ai/ityhg","version":"1.0.0","resolvedFrom":"version","tag":null,"createdAt":1773127332892,"card":{"available":true,"path":"skill-card.md","url":"https://wry-manatee-359.convex.site/api/v1/skills/novel-generator/card?ownerHandle=ityhg&version=1.0.0","sha256":"d4385ca3f7cb9ebf1325ea8a2db9d548de18c65c70495f2cc4361feb8db9f4c9","size":2218,"contentType":"text/markdown; charset=utf-8"},"artifact":{"sourceFingerprint":"d56f724fc9401f5c49eba0f75bc97fc39d341fe8c39782ff2f472a5cd6f5e213","bundleFingerprints":["99b05d017a64237469f14b806862a0b8e4bd69d8d36bc1a669b147ffcbecb2f5","2882487e9e5209ec37db6f294460bd6870ae5bb69d968baf4772cd1eb22a68d1"],"files":[{"path":"README.md","size":4304,"sha256":"91c9944e8132c84c72aa1a6645f70999057dd75d95246477c79e0f364e425eb8","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":12062,"sha256":"3c65bea524730ab9c05aa53d9267106041add2faf9d0e93e8fbc554becac1f8e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":".learnings/LOCATIONS.md","size":185,"sha256":"30ba89f1cd470bedc84bee01bb2c4ccf9afb5a7513aad58eed44c3e02ce71594","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":".learnings/ERRORS.md","size":175,"sha256":"d7622e028be3b448d68cde89f49e7069433fe68d50c85268b430cfa0d476d582","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":".learnings/CHARACTERS.md","size":196,"sha256":"6fb6c388e074c8f69708f2626f7148fbf379b0beb7910ecde36e284ff3be